Damien is the name given by the voice that speaks over the loudspeakers of [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin|the lava ruin]], watching whoever enters through the ruin's cameras. He warns them off the heat and tells them how the ruin's gates are worked, and he speaks of the suited workers as the workers, who cannot work the valves themselves. His accent is not [[Geography/Althane/Oresk/index|Oreskian]], and he says only that he comes from north of the ruin.
